        <p style="font-size:0.6rem;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#e00;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Step 4</p>
        <h3 style="font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:1rem;">Bulk printing</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.7;">Approved prints applied to garments in production. Quality monitored at every printed garment.</p>
