<section style="padding:3rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border)"><div style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1.5rem"><h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2rem);font-weight:600;color:var(--color-text);margin-bottom:1.5rem">Why Partner with SDF Clothing?</h2><p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Printing runs through our own facility across multiple methods — screen printing, DTG, sublimation, and heat transfer — with our team recommending the technique suited to your design rather than defaulting to whichever single method a subcontractor offers. GOTS, OEKO-TEX Standard 100, BSCI, WRAP, and ISO 9001 certification apply.</p><p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Screen printing suits large flat-color runs most cost-effectively at volume; sublimation suits all-over prints on polyester; DTG suits small-run or highly detailed designs where screen setup costs wouldn't pay off. We help match method to order size and design complexity, starting at a 300-piece-per-style minimum, with strike-off approval, bulk printing, and export documentation included.</p><p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Printing adds a processing step and a processing cost, both of which sit on top of Bangladesh's underlying trade position: a 20% US tariff cap from late 2025, and EU duty-free access under Everything But Arms that holds through November 2029 regardless of this November's LDC graduation.</p><p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:2rem">Ready to start? <a href="/contact/" style="color:var(--color-primary)">Request a sample</a> or <a href="/contact/" style="color:var(--color-primary)">contact our team</a> for a detailed FOB quote within 48 hours.</p></div></section>
